 BSE|
 BSE| Excitation n           i =>/<=     a      TDA/ABBA       |X_ia^n|/|Y_ia^n|
 BSE|
 BSE|            1          37    =>    42        -ABBA-                  0.2437
 BSE|            1          40    =>    41        -ABBA-                  0.6315
 BSE|
